  "details": "If you recently pre-download a world and it updates shortly after, attempting to pre-download it again does not visually show that the world is downloading. However, the download does occur in the backend.  \n\n**Steps to Reproduce:**  \n\n1. Pre-download a test world.  \n\n2. Update the world shortly after.  \n\n3. Attempt to pre-download the world again.  \n\n**Observed Behavior:**  \n\nThe button's state does not visually indicate that the pre-download is in progress, even though the download is happening in the backend.  \n\n**Expected Behavior:**  \n\nThe button should update its state to reflect that the world is being downloaded again.",
